        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0410_006_01:ChrEv_0410_006_01_009:beae2df4",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0410_006_01:ChrEv_0410_006_01_009:beae2df4",
        "jp_sha256": "07d4210fbcf593447686df399c406ff8f0b568e7edc5d877cb56092e57e92242",
        "official_en_sha256": "d590dfcc4aebe90c289ea8e77119a2028e417cb4566ea35ad8948850773c1716"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なにより、この人の供述だけ\r\n「事件の後」のことまで言及していたわ。",
        "official_en": "And also, she was the only passenger to talk about any of the events <text style=\"italic\">after</> the incident.",
        "real_en": null
